
# Vocabulary Building

Welcome to my vocabulary learning section!

My goal is to expand my English vocabulary
and understand how to use words in context.

## Learning Categories

1. Daily Vocabulary
2. Academic Vocabulary
3. Phrasal Verbs
4. Synonyms and Antonyms
5. Idioms and Expressions

## Learning Targets

- Learn 10 new words every day.
- Understand word meanings.
- Learn synonyms and antonyms.
- Create original example sentences.
- Review previously learned vocabulary.

## Vocabulary Learning Method

For every new word, I will record:

- Word
- Part of Speech
- Pronunciation
- Indonesian Meaning
- Synonyms
- Example Sentence
- My Own Sentence
